                                "sense_id": "9a79adb4-945e-351c-9422-345b8917530d",
                                "text": "Then the gerontic or senescent portion is seen, recognizable by an increasing simplicity, comparable to that of the neanic shell but retrogressive rather than progressive in the assumption of characters."
